# Stock input name of the Goodix GF816M touch keys (gf816m_keys driver).
# The fingerprint sensor reads the two capacitive pads beside Home.
# 139 is APP_SWITCH (recents) on Android 11, not MENU.
# WAKE: the capacitive HOME pad is the fingerprint sensor; a tap while the
# screen is off must wake the device (task 3).  BACK/RECENTS stay non-waking.
key 102   HOME WAKE
key 139   APP_SWITCH VIRTUAL
key 158   BACK VIRTUAL
